o this surreal world, discovering new abilities and ways to win</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TEAM UP WITH POWERFUL FRIENDS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Brought to life with a full voice cast, Desta meets incredible characters throughout their journey, all with exceptional abilities and powers, each with their own story to tell about their connection to this world</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A CHALLENGING NIGHTMARE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Once you build up your skills, take on Nightmare Mode for the ultimate hardcore tactics challenge where EVERY throw matters</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009650/extras/4a9b733923af59e8eab53e3bd0a1275a.poster.avif?t=1762967887\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009650/extras/4a9b733923af59e8eab53e3bd0a1275a.webm?t=1762967887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009650/extras/4a9b733923af59e8eab53e3bd0a1275a.mp4?t=1762967887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Dream Team Edition</strong> is the digital collector’s edition of Desta: The Memories Between - compiling all major content updates together, including all characters, new game modes (including Challenge Mode and Nightmare Mode), as well a complete game soundtrack composed by acclaimed UK Artist Mansur Brown and a beautiful Digital Art Book.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009650/extras/852128ae23fb835bfd33c718158179af.poster.avif?t=1762967887\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009650/extras/852128ae23fb835bfd33c718158179af.webm?t=1